<view class="detail-page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">发布合作需求</view>
    <view class="card-desc">描述你希望获得的帮助，资源与需求可以双向连接。发布内容需经校友会审核后才会公开展示。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">所属盟市<text class="required">*</text></text>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{regions}}" range-key="name" value="{{regionIndex}}" bindchange="onRegionChange">
        <view class="picker-value {{regionIndex < 0 ? 'placeholder' : ''}}">
          {{regionIndex < 0 ? '请选择所属盟市' : regions[regionIndex].name}}
        </view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">所属领域<text class="required">*</text></text>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{industries}}" range-key="name" value="{{industryIndex}}" bindchange="onIndustryChange">
        <view class="picker-value {{industryIndex < 0 ? 'placeholder' : ''}}">
          {{industryIndex < 0 ? '请选择所属领域' : industries[industryIndex].name}}
        </view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">简短标题<text class="required">*</text></text>
      <input
        class="form-input"
        value="{{title}}"
        maxlength="42"
        placeholder="例如：寻求文旅项目运营与品牌合作"
        bindinput="onTitleInput"
      />
      <text class="form-hint">5–42 字，让校友一眼明白你希望获得什么。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">详细说明<text class="required">*</text></text>
      <textarea
        class="form-textarea"
        value="{{body}}"
        maxlength="400"
        placeholder="说明需求背景、合作目标以及希望对接的资源……"
        bindinput="onBodyInput"
      ></textarea>
      <text class="form-hint">10–400 字，可写明需求背景与合作目标。</text>
    </view>

    <text class="form-error" wx:if="{{submitError}}">{{submitError}}</text>

    <view class="notice-box">
      发布信息会进入校友会审核流程。未经审核通过的内容不会出现在连接广场，请确保内容真实、表述得体。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="fixed-bar" wx:if="{{success}}">
    <view class="success-panel">
      <view class="success-title">发布已提交</view>
      <view class="success-desc">校友会审核通过后，信息会出现在连接广场。</view>
      <view class="btn-row">
        <button class="btn-soft btn-block" bindtap="onBackToList">返回广场</button>
        <button class="btn-main btn-block" bindtap="onViewStatus">查看审核状态</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="fixed-bar" wx:elif="{{!success}}">
    <button class="btn-main btn-block" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="onSubmit">
      {{submitting ? '提交中…' : '提交发布'}}
    </button>
  </view>
</view>
